e coming to wipe him out in  the future characters like Brian John  and Daenerys I think the night King knew  they would eventually come so he is  reacting to them and that's why he  started to amass an army the night King  started to prepare for this day before  they were even born I don't think any of  this happened by accident or coincidence  Bloodraven has been manipulating the  events in Westeros for a very long time  and I think the night King was preparing  for this - that's why the night king  wanted to kill bloodraven so bad because  it was personal he knew bloodraven was  going to do everything in his power to  kill the others that's why the night  king walked straight into the cave and  took out bloodraven first that's why the  night king looked very pissed off when  he finally got his chance to come face  to face with the man who was moving all  the chess pieces to end the White  Walkers for good that's also how the  night King knew bran was gonna be there  in the vision it was a setup he knew  exactly where to catch bran to be able  to touch him and enter the cave to  finally kill Bloodraven then I King  knows when certain events were gonna  happen because he's seeing things  through the weirwood net - the night  King tried to spring a trap on John the  night king could have wiped out hardhome  and anytime that he wanted to but he  waited until John showed up because he  needs to kill John because he knows he's  one of the few characters that will  threaten the existence of the others he  also sprung the trap on Daenerys inner  dragons he was only able to kill one  dragon but he almost killed - none of  this is an accident in my opinion the  night King was waiting for this day to  come just like bloodraven was but now  it's up to bran to carry on that  knowledge this is another reason why I  think the night king is heading for  Winterfell because he knows everyone  will be there  brain especially the next question is  from low to a do you think when John  knows the truth about himself he will  let Daenerys claim the throne or not  because in the first season when a mole  and talked to John he said what is honor  compared to a woman's love what is Duty  against a feel of a newborn son in your  arms in this case maybe John will let  her get the  thrown and their son will not be a  bastard and if she is not pregnant  perhaps he would not make that decision  like a mom I know I've always felt this  way about John we all know he has no  desire to rule the Seven Kingdoms he  didn't even want to rule the Nights  Watch although he was happy that the men  thought he was fit to do so but it was  never his goal John wanted to be a  ranger not the ruler I think John will  basically do what Amon did John is  technically next in line but he will  refuse the position and give it to  Daenerys if she still wants to rule the  Seven Kingdoms by the end John will  probably help make some of the decisions  so all the people can live a better life  but I could never see him wanting to sit  on the Iron Throne and I don't even  think Daenerys will want the throne by  the end either  I think the Iron Throne will be  destroyed and they will split the  kingdoms up into different territories  but just to stay on track from the  original question I think John will pass  on the opportunity to roll like a moun  did and he will step aside for Daenerys  if she wants the position still but I  think they will figure out a new way to  keep things in order and make Westeros a  more civilized place to live I wanted to  try to keep this video under 20 minutes  long or else that will take over ten  hours to make so I'm gonna end this one  right here if you still have some  questions please put them down below and  I will make another Q&amp;A video like this  I want to thank everyone that submitted  some questions and I want to thank all  of you for watching and I have to give a  special thanks to everyone on patreon  for continuing to support the channe